      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHANGES (1) gave his opponents no chance last start when he cruised to a 20 metres victory over 1609m at Tamworth. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Finds a nice race and will take plenty of beating once more. SIERRA MIST (2) finished ninth last start over 1609m at Tamworth, beaten 170 metres, after a strong win at this track the run prior. Has the benefit of a good draw. Her last run should be overlooked. Good enough to put herself back in the winners' stall. STAY FOOLISH (7) disappointed last time when ninth over 1609m at this track. Can make amends. RAINBOW TITAN (5) is in the mix if he can recapture the form from two starts back that saw him score over 1980m at Tamworth.",
